  "summary": "Bind public guidance and the complete Small Shop state-version rerun.",
  "why": "The public documentation now separates the domain ontology, domain-history profile, append-only protocol history, and replayed graph. Every Small Shop population plan binds the shipped state-version profile, while the inspection-note path demonstrates the source-assertion profile and retained epistemic trace. This records the documented and research-fixture evidence without turning either fixture's choices into universal Malleus rules."
